  "details": "Due to the new \"laser pointer\" changes (likely which bone it's anchored to), clicking things with it makes it move slightly, making it not select what you're trying to click. Half-pressing the trigger to prepare to click beforehand is a way to circumvent the worst of it, but it's not a fix in the long-run. \n\nSeparately, the laser pointer is now very difficult to aim due to the fact is is no longer consistently-placed in the hand and that head rotation affects it.",
